 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Tensor-Hom equivalences from an exact dual pair",
 "statement": "Let X be a scheme [def-pc-scheme] and let C=D_{\\mathrm{QCoh}}(\\mathcal O_X) [def-pc-derived-category], equipped with its derived tensor monoidal structure. Let K and K^\\vee be objects equipped with an exact pairing (evaluation K^\\vee\\otimes K\\to\\mathbb 1 and coevaluation \\mathbb 1\\to K\\otimes K^\\vee satisfying the zig-zag identities), and let A and B be objects of C. Then there are natural equivalences Hom_C(K\\otimes A,B)\\simeq Hom_C(A,K^\\vee\\otimes B) and Hom_C(A,K\\otimes B)\\simeq Hom_C(K^\\vee\\otimes A,B).",
 "source": {
  "document": "Mathlib/CategoryTheory/Monoidal/Rigid/Basic.lean",
  "place": "definitions tensorLeftHomEquiv (line 386) and tensorRightHomEquiv (line 410)"
 },
